---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Test S3 upload with a file

Usage: qam s3 test [OPTIONS] <file>

Arguments:
  <file>  File to upload

Options:
      --bucket <bucket>      S3 bucket (overrides default)
      --config <path>        Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --key <key>            Object key or template
      --endpoint <endpoint>  S3 endpoint URL (overrides default)
      --region <region>      S3 region (overrides default)
  -h, --help                 Print help
